    "partial_frame_stop": "mapper commits only emitted words; callback-stop preserves native partial carry. attempts-completed may be1; mapped symbol bound is inclusive at the next frame boundary. Output stops before worker join; SPI remains alive until encoder quiescence, then is stopped before arena restoration.",
