    ],
    "bulk_mapper": "Independent final-source audit found no blocker: writes stop at credit64 or ring wrap; complete n is committed before callbacks, false callbacks do no new writes, and16 partial carry is preserved.",
    "capture": "Boundary uses exact ceil(hz*ms/(8000*cpw*frame_symbols))*frame_symbols. Nominal timer trigger one1024-symbol block early avoids late DMA-observation quantization. Host still requires bounded exact8192 bus observations spanning the full90-symbol PLHEADER; no timing guarantee is inferred from the trigger alone.",
